---
import { igorVepretskiSeo } from "../data/igor-vepretski-seo"
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{igorVepretskiSeo.title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={igorVepretskiSeo.description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={igorVepretskiSeo.canonicalUrl} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="profile" />
    <meta property="og:url" content={igorVepretskiSeo.canonicalUrl} />
    <meta property="og:title" content={igorVepretskiSeo.title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={igorVepretskiSeo.description} />
    <meta property="og:image" content={igorVepretskiSeo.ogImage} />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content={igorVepretskiSeo.ogImageAlt} />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content={igorVepretskiSeo.twitterTitle} />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content={igorVepretskiSeo.twitterDescription} />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content={igorVepretskiSeo.ogImage} />
    <meta name="twitter:image:alt" content={igorVepretskiSeo.ogImageAlt} />
    <style>
      :root{color-scheme:dark;--text:#f7fbff;--muted:#a9b8c4;--line:rgba(255,255,255,.14);--cyan:#34edff;--gold:#f7cf72;--green:#9bff7d;--panel:rgba(255,255,255,.065);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;background:#030405;color:var(--text)}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;background:radial-gradient(circle at 16% 0%,rgba(52,237,255,.22),transparent 31rem),radial-gradient(circle at 86% 12%,rgba(247,207,114,.15),transparent 30rem),linear-gradient(145deg,#010203,#071018 56%,#000);overflow-x:hidden}.shell{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:auto}.nav{position:sticky;top:12px;z-index:10;margin-top:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;background:rgba(3,4,5,.76);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;font-weight:1000;letter-spacing:.08em}.mark{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:17px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#071014;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cyan),var(--gold))}.navlinks{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.pill{display:inline-flex;padding:10px 13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);font-weight:820;color:#dbe8ef}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);gap:clamp(26px,6vw,72px);align-items:center;padding:82px 0 52px}.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;margin-bottom:20px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid rgba(155,255,125,.34);background:rgba(155,255,125,.08);border-radius:999px;color:#eaffdf;font-weight:950;font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase}h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(3.4rem,8.4vw,8rem);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.078em}.gradient{background:linear-gradient(92deg,#fff,var(--cyan),var(--green),var(--gold));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}.lede{margin:24px 0 0;max-width:760px;color:#d9e6ec;font-size:clamp(1.08rem,2.1vw,1.36rem);line-height:1.65}.cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:30px}.cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:50px;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cyan),var(--green));color:#031115;font-weight:1000}.cta.secondary{border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.055);color:var(--text)}.card{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:32px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,rgba(255,255,255,.12),rgba(255,255,255,.045));box-shadow:0 34px 110px rgba(0,0,0,.42);padding:24px}.status{display:grid;gap:12px}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:12px;padding:14px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.11);border-radius:18px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.22)}.row span{color:var(--muted)}.row b{text-align:right}.section{padding:34px 0}.section h2{margin:0 0 18px;font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.055em}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}.tile{min-height:184px;padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;background:var(--panel)}.tile.big{grid-column:span 2}.tile .k{display:inline-flex;margin-bottom:14px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:1000;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.tile h3{margin:0 0 9px;font-size:1.35rem}.tile p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}.note{margin:24px 0 64px;padding:22px;border:1px solid rgba(247,207,114,.25);border-radius:26px;background:rgba(247,207,114,.08);color:#f6e8c0}.footer{padding:28px 0 42px;color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}@media(max-width:900px){.nav{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:52px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tile.big{grid-column:auto}.cta{width:100%}h1{font-size:clamp(3.5rem,15vw,6.2rem)}}
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="shell nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="mark">7</span><span>#7YA</span></a><nav class="navlinks" aria-label="Primary"><a class="pill" href="/">Home</a><a class="pill" href="/talk/">Talk</a><a class="pill" href="/social/">Signal</a><a class="pill" href="/member-pass/">Pass</a></nav></header>
    <main class="shell">
      <section class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">Canonical founder root</span><h1><span class="gradient">Igor Vepretski</span><br />#7YA.</h1><p class="lede">Founder-builder operating where public narrative, technology systems, creator distribution, source-aware trust, and StartOn meet. This page is the clean public identity route for platforms, collaborators, and search.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="cta" href="/talk/">Start a conversation →</a><a class="cta secondary" href="/social/">View public signal</a><a class="cta secondary" href="/docs/my-links.md">Open route map</a></div></div><aside class="card"><h2>Public root</h2><div class="status"><div class="row"><span>Identity</span><b>Igor Vepretski / #7YA</b></div><div class="row"><span>Platform</span><b>7YA</b></div><div class="row"><span>Impact layer</span><b>StartOn</b></div><div class="row"><span>Policy</span><b>Source-aware language</b></div><div class="row"><span>Publishing</span><b>GitHub + Vercel</b></div></div></aside></section>
      <section class="section"><h2>Root ontology.</h2><div class="grid"><article class="tile"><span class="k">Builder</span><h3>Systems before slogans.</h3><p>Public-facing flows, source layers, UX surfaces, and operational routes built to reduce noise.</p></article><article class="tile"><span class="k">Founder</span><h3>7YA and StartOn.</h3><p>Connects personal brand, public trust, practical projects, and execution into one owned web layer.</p></article><article class="tile"><span class="k">Creator</span><h3>Distribution with intent.</h3><p>Creator culture is used as signal and reach, then routed back into owned context and next steps.</p></article></div></section>
      <section class="section"><h2>Operating layers.</h2><div class="grid"><article class="tile big"><span class="k">Public trust</span><h3>Source before escalation.</h3><p>Public language stays careful and avoids unsupported claims unless a visible proof route supports it.</p></article><article class="tile"><span class="k">Developer ecosystem</span><h3>Tools, not decoration.</h3><p>Microsoft, NVIDIA, OpenAI, Google, GitHub, and Vercel are treated as infrastructure and ecosystem context with precise wording.</p></article><article class="tile"><span class="k">Direct route</span><h3>Talk is the intake.</h3><p>Ideas, partnerships, media requests, and serious next steps should flow through the 7YA Talk route.</p></article><article class="tile big"><span class="k">Owned web</span><h3>The domain is the base.</h3><p>7ya.io is the anchor. Social platforms are distribution; the site is the canonical surface.</p></article></div></section>
      <div class="note">Public language here is premium and conservative. It builds authority without inventing proof. That is the 7YA standard.</div>
    </main>
    <footer class="shell footer">#7YA · Igor Vepretski · Canonical public identity · Signal first.</footer>
  </body>
</html>
